# RMC's own store, ignored here because this repo's lessons are about RMC
# development rather than something to ship. In a normal project you usually
# WANT to commit .rmc/nodes and .rmc/episodes so the team shares the lessons and
# their regression corpus — `.rmc/.gitignore` already excludes the machine-local
# parts (sessions/, events.jsonl). See docs/integration.md.
.rmc/
!examples/**/.rmc/
sandbox/
*.log
